{% import "partials/macros.njk" as ui with context %}
<main id="main" class="wrap">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Peddinti Sri Ram Bharadwaj, though most people call me Sriram.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>I am a reinforcement learning researcher. Right now I'm working independently on continual self-play for LLM post-training, and on plasticity collapse: why networks slowly lose the ability to learn when the world they train in keeps changing.</p>
    <p>I came to this through an M.Tech in Computer Science at IIIT Bangalore and a research internship at IISc's Stochastic Systems Lab, where I co-developed the SOR family of Bellman update rules. I like working at both ends of the stack. On one end is measure-theoretic RL theory. On the other is the machinery underneath it: Vulkan compute shaders on Android, and the build internals of PyTorch and ExecuTorch.</p>
    <p>Outside the lab I write by hand, take photographs, and I've been reading Camus. The absurd keeps turning up in my essays.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="buttons" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
